 "fetched": "2026-10-26T14:44:35.465Z",
 "url": "https://www.iimb.ac.in/programmes/doctoral-programme",
 "title": "Doctoral Programme in Management (PhD) Overview | IIM Bangalore",
 "text": "DOCTOR OF PHILOSOPHY (PhD)\nInstitute Events\n\nIMRDC 2027\n\nIMRDC 2026\n\nJoint Brown Bag Seminar Series\n\nThis is a collective effort of Doctoral students from IIMA, IIMB and IIMC. The seminars will be held online, once a month, on the last Friday of the month, from 3 pm to 4 pm. \n\nView more\n\nFor more information on Admission 2027\n\nAdmission 2027\n\nProgramme Objectives\n\nSpecializations\n\nAdmissions\n\nStudents\n\nAchievements\n\nInstitute Research Award 2026\n\nAlumni\n\nMessage from the Chairperson\n\nResearch Exchange Visit\n\nResearch Excellence and Recognition\n\nIndustry Scholarship Impact 2025-26\n\nPhD Events\n\nPhD thesis presentation on October 1, 2026\nBoggadi Sudheer Kumar Reddy, PhD student in the Decision Sciences area, will present his thesis, ‘Second-Order Cone Programming-Based Constructs for Solving Mixed-Integer Programs with Applications to Batch Scheduling Problems,’\n\nView more\n\nRegister for Information session\n\nSchedule for Information session\n\n \nTESTIMONIALS\nCurrent\nAlumni\n\nWhat makes my PhD journey at IIM Bangalore truly unique is the opportunity to explore diverse disciplines for two years, while learning from world-class faculty. The close faculty interactions and the chance to learn alongside brilliant peers have made this an incredibly enriching experience.\n\n- Mir Autif Mohammad,\nStrategy, IIMB\n\nIIM Bangalore has opened up a world of possibilities for me as a researcher. From world-class research resources and global collaborations to exposure through leading conferences, the programme has equipped me to pursue high-quality research with confidence.\n\n- Samirit Saha,\nInformation Systems, IIMB\n\nOne of the greatest strengths of the PhD programme at IIM Bangalore is the balance it strikes between academic rigour and intellectual exploration. The interdisciplinary learning and mentorship from exceptional faculty have transformed the way I approach research.\n\n- Amrutha Girish,\nEntrepreneurship, IIMB\n\nWhat sets the PhD programme at IIM Bangalore apart is its structured milestones, collaborative cohort, and vibrant research ecosystem. Regular seminars, workshops, and a beautiful campus create an environment where you can grow academically while maintaining a healthy balance.\n\n- Vandana Saini,\nEconomics, IIMB\n\nMy PhD journey at IIM Bangalore has been intellectually enriching and transformative. Rigorous coursework, world-class faculty, and a supportive peer community have given me a strong foundation to pursue meaningful, impactful research.\n\n- Midhila K S,\nMarketing, IIMB\n\nIIM Bangalore offers the ideal environment to begin a doctoral journey. Its world-class research ecosystem, inspiring faculty, and diverse PhD community create endless opportunities to learn, collaborate, and grow as a researcher.\n\n- Harishanker P,\nMarketing, IIMB\n\nIIM Bangalore prepared me for every aspect of an academic career. Along with rigorous research training, the programme offered invaluable teaching opportunities that helped me grow as both a researcher and an educator. The continuous support of faculty and the Doctoral Programme Office made the journey especially rewarding.\n\n- Shiril Saju,\nProduction and Operations Management, IIMB\n\nMy doctoral journey at IIM Bangalore transformed the way I approach research. Rigorous coursework, hands-on research training, international conference exposure, and exceptional faculty mentorship equipped me with the skills and confidence to grow into an independent researcher.\n\n- Boggadi Sudheer Kumar Reddy,\nDecision Sciences, IIMB.\n\nWhat I valued most at IIM Bangalore was its supportive and collaborative research environment. Approachable faculty, a diverse peer community, and rigorous research training helped me become a confident, independent researcher, preparing me for research-driven careers in both academia and industry.\n\n- Chinmay Jayant Divekar,\nDecision Sciences, IIMB\n\nWhat sets the PhD programme at IIM Bangalore apart is its personalized mentorship and strong research culture. The thoughtfully designed coursework, approachable faculty, and small doctoral classes helped me build the skills, confidence, and mindset to grow into an independent researcher\n\n- Mauli Kundlia,\nOBHRM, IIMB\n\nWhat sets the Marketing PhD at IIM Bangalore apart is the freedom to pursue your own research questions, guided by advisors who continually challenge you to think deeper. Rigorous training in econometrics and causal inference builds strong research foundations, while the programme equips you to grow into an independent scholar.\n\n- Tejaswi Kalaga,\nMarketing, IIMB\n\n2026 Institute Research Award: Divya Dwivedi, PhD\n\nPhD scholar Satyajit Roy, Production and Operations Management area\n\nPhD scholar Sabhya Rai, Economics area\n\nPhD scholar Sonal Nayak, Strategy area\n\nFAQs | Accreditation & Rankings | Contact Us | Programmes Home",
